+- [ ] **Step 4: Update Root Layout**
+Modify `src/app/layout.tsx` to wrap `children` in a `div` that includes `<AppNav />`.
+- [ ] **Step 5: Run test (passes)**
+Run: `pnpm playwright test tests/e2e/layout.spec.ts`
+Expected: PASS
