+
+### Task 2: Geolocation & Clock Server Actions
+
+**Files:**
+- Create: `src/app/actions/time.ts`
+- Create: `src/hooks/use-clock.ts`
+- Test: `tests/unit/use-clock.test.ts` (using jsdom)
+
+**Interfaces:**
